;    6: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=てい, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=82, unk2=255, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=11, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=だま, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=313, unk2=16757864, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=12, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=さいぎしん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=てきがいしん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=かつ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   14: TDecorate(count=24, unk2=13464750, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   15: TDecorate(count=11, unk2=5265653, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   16: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=すみ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   17: TDecorate(count=31, unk2=16757864, unk3=4294967295, unk4=48, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   18: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=11271932, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ひきょう, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=7641, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=6952, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵火事後.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The storehouse fire burned only the second floor and didn't spread anywhere else.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The stench of water-soaked embers hangs over the whole settlement.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I was sent back to my room again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> and the others should be investigating the storehouse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now that I know why I'm being isolated like this, I have no particular complaint.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is the best method, and my way of actively cooperating.<PG>
Even so, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> and the others are late getting back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
Still no reply from <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> to my message―it isn't even marked read.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>, you're safe, right? You're okay, right?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I kept staring at the unchanging message screen.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Um, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A knock from the hallway, and <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan's</STYLE> voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Come in."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe because my heart was calmer than before, I managed to raise my voice more than I'd expected.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Good, you look well."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Do I?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> doesn't like keeping you shut up in here all the time either, so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey, why am I being kept shut up in here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="3">"Th-that's, um, well, um..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> is openly <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ろうばい">flustered</STYLE> by my question.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A slightly mean question, but I have to keep up the <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="てい">pose</STYLE> of not knowing why I'm shut in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Keep it up toward <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>, and toward <STYLE ID="7">Necro</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That said, keeping up this stance is anything but pleasant.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"U-um, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s going to look for </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, and she wants you to come too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"What!? Really!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, can you leave right away?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Um... yeah, I'm fine!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was unexpected.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Will it be all right for me to go with them?<PG>
But I'm just as worried about <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>. There's no reason to refuse to go.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if going out is scary, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> not coming back is scarier.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! I brought her!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you're letting me help too!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes! We're going to search for </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Here's one place I'd better make sure <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, too, sees my <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="てい">pose</STYLE> of not knowing.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Then just </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and I will go there!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, shouldn't you be looking into the storehouse!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> must not want to leave <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> and me alone together.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> might let something slip again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"No! We have to go, all three of us...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Right now you should do what </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> says!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"O-okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That settles it. The rest is going along with whatever <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> says and stating my own thoughts.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All of it to keep <STYLE ID="7">Necro</STYLE> <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Still, it really doesn't feel good...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is keeping <STYLE ID="7">Necro</STYLE> <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE> really the right thing?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Keeping <STYLE ID="7">Necro</STYLE> <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE> means keeping everyone <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Does that really lead to a solution?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\荒田枯れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"It's about 10 minutes into this forest."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"You call it a forest, but the trees are almost all dead..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, they weren't like this a little while ago..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The trees around here were almost all dead where they stood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The trees inside the settlement had been the same way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What on earth has happened...?<PG>
I'm sure that when I saw them this evening, the trees were sturdy and putting out new buds.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At first I thought they only looked different because it had gotten dark, but that doesn't seem to be it after all.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, this is apparently the work of </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Necro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―or </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, as it's called, a fungus that covers this whole area. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It seems to strip this mountain of its nutrients, root and all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> fell silent at that point.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. So she can't say any more than that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> referred to <STYLE ID="7">Necro</STYLE> as <STYLE ID="7">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>, but is that something she learned from the books in the storehouse?<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> is a fungus breeding around here―
{PAUSE ""}
and a fungus means something in the mold-and-mushroom family, right?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And <STYLE ID="7">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> sucked up these trees' nutrients, so they withered.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Beyond <STYLE ID="7">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> being a fungus that steals other plants' nutrients, I don't know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's all the information I can get from <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>.<PG>
The rest is for me to keep deceiving <STYLE ID="7">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> by pretending to know nothing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd like <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> to notice how much I know, if she can, but with my gift for talk that's a tall order...<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Wait."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suddenly <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> stepped in front of us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Turning her back to us, she watched our surroundings intently.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"What's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Quiet... someone's there."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Could it be </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> took a knife in each hand.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜ナイフ1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\竹林黒霧.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Who's there!? You're there, aren't you!? Come out!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>, knives raised, shouted at the top of her voice―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神軍団武器.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
From behind trees and out of the dead grass, people in Noh masks and red robes crept into view.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The big moon in the sky lit the nata and maces in their hands.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What? These people..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Probably people from the settlement..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Residents of the Arata settlement!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The people who were helping put out the fire until just now―why would they dress so menacingly...<PG>
"<STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>. Our guests. Turn back at once. You must not go beyond this point."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Move! I have to find </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Are they blocking us from looking for <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Dressed like this, with weapons, even.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something must have happened to <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Get behind me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> pulled me by the arm, and we stepped back behind <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A girl as small as <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> taking on a crowd of adults―that's reckless!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Isn't there some way to slip past them and get to <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>?<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Mm... Everyone, wait!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just then, a woman's shout came from beyond the residents.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>? <STYLE ID="10">Obasan</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, it's neither of their voices.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Who could it be?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "escape.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱ナイフ血.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
