I'd hoped to mix in lies and keep <STYLE ID="7">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE> to put us at an advantage, but that means <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="だま">deceiving</STYLE> everyone too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yet I thought that would make our actions and thoughts fall out of step and only invite needless confusion.<PG>
Even now we don't know what everyone is doing or thinking; stirring that up further is dangerous.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unify our will properly and band together to face it, and a thread toward a solution might show―
{PAUSE ""}
that's what I thought.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It may be a selfish judgment, but I can't see us standing up to something as big as <STYLE ID="7">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> in this state.<PG>
Try to face it alone and you end up missing like <STYLE ID="9">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, or fighting covered in blood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everyone told me―"Trust everyone."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then I'll tell you... um..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is this the rest of what <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> started to say and broke off?<PG>
