<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was at the abandoned hut this morning?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is <STYLE ID="3">this girl</STYLE> saying...<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Then when you said she was missing...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'd found her. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> kept saying weird things."</STYLE><PG>
