{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I went in, and sure enough, <STYLE ID="9">Sis</STYLE> was there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But she was lying curled up in a <STYLE ID="16" RUBY="すみ">corner</STYLE>, facing the wall, with her hands over her ears...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I listened closely, she kept muttering weird things.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
