{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"I don't want to die... I don't want to die...! There's no way we can win!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　We should just surrender...! Everyone should just become cherry trees!"</STYLE>
