{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Don't tell me you left </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> there..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I didn't know what to do. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">―I thought I should bring her along, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She couldn't bring herself to speak to her, and left her there in the abandoned hut, she said.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if it's your sister, seeing someone trembling and muttering <STYLE ID="9">"everyone die"</STYLE> would be a little creepy, sure.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And for a little kid like <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>, all the more...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">but to tell the truth... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> coming home scared me."</STYLE>
