<STYLE ID="3">　She kept saying </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> were the culprits and poking around, and this morning she was saying everyone should die... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had gone strange, I thought...!"</STYLE><PG>
Suspecting her family, and muttering to herself that she wished everyone dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How frightening it would be to have someone like that in the family―
{PAUSE ""}
asking a grade-schooler for a calm judgment was too cruel, it seems.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> seems to regret it, but even now she probably doesn't know what she should do.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"For now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> was alive, so that's good. </STYLE>
