{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It could be read as concern for our safety.<PG>
If we, <STYLE ID="9">Chiga-nee</STYLE> included, had misread that―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Fearing <STYLE ID="7">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s shadow and <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="だま">deceiving</STYLE> each other is wrong, after all!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Secrets, <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="だま">deceptions</STYLE>―as ways to solve this case they're utter nonsense.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
