<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then you have something important that nobody else has, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That's why everyone loves </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> so much!"</STYLE><PG>
People often say my strong point is my mental strength.
