{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm not doing it consciously; maybe I just hate seeing everyone face different ways and fall apart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At times like that, I work to hold everyone together, even a little.<PG>
What I can do isn't keeping <STYLE ID="7">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
